<title>GERMANY: German June retail sales up real 2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German June retail sales up real 2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Federal Statistics Office said on Wednesday that retail sales in June rose two percent year-on-year in real terms and three percent in nominal terms.</p>
<p>The office also said that in the first six months of 1997, retail sales fell one percent in real terms and were unchanged in nominal terms.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
